Hi darlings! Happy Friday  ~ I hope you enjoy this video of my current skincare routine with a few beauty favourites! Don’t forget to give your skin time to learn a new product, I’ve found the best and true results come when I finish a product and my skin learns it. This is also good for the environment as it means less waste and an empty jar to recycle afterwards. The 60 second face wash is a game changer too thanks to @labeautyologist! The full video is on my #IGTV. ✨ • products mentioned. 
