Rise n’ Glow beautiful people. ✨ ~ 
I always see beauty tutorials on my feed with people that already have flawless skin and I thought it would be fun to create content that also sheds light on people with open pores, textured skin, hair on skin and unfiltered skin. I always love to learn and connecting with Djena Nefertiti (@nefertiti_21) was exactly what I needed to see how I can achieve better results with my own make-up. thank you to @studio.arva for giving us the space and @evaschwank for filming! The full video is on my #IGTV. ~ productDetails ✨
